WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.425
The prince stumbled through the forest for hours.

2
00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:12.700
His leg hurt, and one arm was broken.

3
00:00:12.701 --> 00:00:16.802
"I will find my way to the palace," he thought.

4
00:00:16.803 --> 00:00:20.708
"Then I will go back to the tower, and . . . oof!"

5
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:23.912
The prince tripped on a tree root.

6
00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:28.849
As he fell forward, sharp thorns scratched his face.

7
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:34.128
His head hit a big rock.

8
00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:40.633
Then everything went black.

9
00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:45.343
The next morning Rapunzel woke at sunrise.

10
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:50.467
"Oh no! I fell asleep," she thought.

11
00:00:50.468 --> 00:00:57.282
She began looking for the prince again.

12
00:00:57.283 --> 00:01:00.686
Suddenly Prickle flew to her.

13
00:01:00.687 --> 00:01:04.491
He flapped his wings and chirped.

14
00:01:04.492 --> 00:01:07.114
"Prickle!" Rapunzel said.

15
00:01:07.115 --> 00:01:11.779
"Do you want me to follow you?"

16
00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:15.794
Prickle took off through the forest.

17
00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:21.261
Rapunzel ran after him.

18
00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:24.425
At last, Prickle stopped.

19
00:01:24.426 --> 00:01:29.424
He chirped loudly near some thornbushes.

20
00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:33.578
Beyond the thornbushes was a ditch.

21
00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:40.830
Rapunzel ran to the ditch and peered down.

22
00:01:40.831 --> 00:01:46.175
Someone lay in the mud!

23
00:01:46.176 --> 00:01:49.518
"Prince!" Rapunzel cried.

24
00:01:49.519 --> 00:01:52.028
There was no answer.

25
00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:56.050
She yelled again. "Prince!"

26
00:01:56.051 --> 00:02:01.623
At last she heard a low moan.

27
00:02:01.624 --> 00:02:06.080
"Rapunzel?" the prince said weakly.

28
00:02:06.081 --> 00:02:10.812
"Yes!" Rapunzel cried. "It's me!"

29
00:02:10.813 --> 00:02:15.187
Rapunzel ran into the ditch.

30
00:02:15.188 --> 00:02:18.608
She grabbed the prince's hand.

31
00:02:18.609 --> 00:02:24.338
He tried to sit up, but he was too weak.

32
00:02:24.339 --> 00:02:28.778
"Don't move, Prince!" Rapunzel said.

33
00:02:28.779 --> 00:02:34.239
"How did you get out of the tower?" he asked.

34
00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:39.372
"I will explain everything later," Rapunzel said.

35
00:02:39.373 --> 00:02:43.331
Rapunzel checked the prince's wounds.

36
00:02:43.332 --> 00:02:46.326
He had scratches on his face.

37
00:02:46.327 --> 00:02:49.684
There was a large cut on his head.

38
00:02:49.685 --> 00:02:53.854
His breathing was weak.

39
00:02:53.855 --> 00:02:57.405
Tears streamed from Rapunzel's eyes.

40
00:02:57.406 --> 00:03:02.065
"I found you, my darling prince!" she said.

41
00:03:02.066 --> 00:03:07.438
"Now I must find a way to save you!"

42
00:03:07.439 --> 00:03:13.510
She grabbed her healing potions and gasped.

43
00:03:13.511 --> 00:03:17.709
They were almost gone!

44
00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:27.788
"Oh no! I used them all on the witch!"

